{ The steady limit of av_stor_two_masses_dynamic: with NO DYNAMIC block the
  storage equations take the rhs = 0 branch, which must recover exactly the
  algebraic operating point the transient converges to (446.667 / 406.667). }
Q_in = 800
Tamb = 300
HeatSource    HS(Q = Q_in)
ThermalMass   M1(C = 5000, T0 = 300)
Conduction    w12(k = 2, area = 1, L = 0.1)
ThermalMass   M2(C = 8000, T0 = 310)
Conduction    w2a(k = 1.5, area = 1, L = 0.2)
ThermalSource amb(T = Tamb)
connect(HS.port, M1.port, w12.a)
connect(w12.b, M2.port, w2a.a)
connect(w2a.b, amb.port)
t1 = M1.port.T
t2 = M2.port.T
